<title>USA: Ruby Tuesday eyes 3.84 pct buyback.</title>
<headline>Ruby Tuesday eyes 3.84 pct buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE, Ala. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ruby Tuesday Inc said a preliminary count of its Dutch Auction tender offer indicated that 676,028 shares were tendered at or below $22.00 per share.</p>
<p>In a press release on Tuesday, the company said that it expects to purchase all shares tendered and that the shares represent about 3.84 percent of its shares outstanding.</p>
<p>After purchasing the shares, the company will have about 17,039,785 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Ruby Tuesday announced the tender offer on May 1, expressing its intentions to purchase up to one million shares at a purchase price ranging from $20 to $22 per share.</p>
